Turning on sync shares these with this vault's other Macs, and only them:
- 3 transcript lines, 2026-01-01 to 2026-03-31 (UTC), each with its full text, speaker name and timing. 1 is a note you wrote; 2 carry a voiceprint (numbers describing the speaker's voice)
- 1 speaker name set on a line
- 1 correction of line text
- 2 vocabulary words
- 2 places: Home (records everything; with its map area), Gym (doesn't record)
- 3 deleted records, sent without their text (a deleted place keeps its name)
Never shared: audio (chunks/, recent/, fixes/), the voiceprint registry (voices/), where this Mac is now (here.json), voices you ignore (ignore.json), what the transcriber learned (learned.json), transcript.txt, context/ copies, labels, stats, and logs.
This preview only read files here; nothing was sent.
